  instructions:
  - "1. Insert right controller into socket 1 \u2192 press hand trigger."
  - "2. Repeat for sockets 2\u20134."
  - 3. Complete the console calibration with the controller first.
  - "4.Start with right or left stylus. \u2192 insert stylus into socket 1 (on the
    corresponding side) \u2192 press dark button."
  - "5. Insert right stylus into socket 1 \u2192 press dark button."
  - "6.Insert left stylus into socket 1 \u2192 press dark button."
  - 7. Repeat for another stylus.
